## Context
Child of 1102. Three independent tests validate the links in the v8 pilot
protocol, results and integration review, and these paths are outside the
pilot's own relative-link resolver. Prepare their historical citations before
1106 migrates `memory/DREAM.md` and `memory/dreams/`. Preserve dated prose,
citations, revisions and recorded blob IDs. These are immutable archive links,
not runtime paths or aliases.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] Replace links to `memory/DREAM.md` and `memory/dreams/` artifacts in the
