## Test
In `tests/test_memory_v8_protocol.py`, parse the prompt link, require the
canonical GitHub blob URL with a full 40-character commit, and verify with
`git rev-parse <commit>:memory/DREAM.md` that it equals the recorded full blob
`6087a0b3f641bdc4cbeac595e87d174eb11bcbf5`. Existing link checks in all three
test modules must remain strict for repository-relative targets.

## Plan
